        "subject": "LU-21086 tests: settle deletes before sanity-sec quota check",
        "message": "LU-21086 tests: settle deletes before sanity-sec quota check\n\ndo_fops_quota_test() samples quota usage, writes 1 MiB and expects\nusage to grow by 1 MiB. The baseline was taken while removals from\nearlier iterations and tests were still freeing OST blocks, so usage\ncould fall between the samples (e.g. 22604 to 1024 KiB) and fail the\ncheck.\n\nSync and wait for deletes to complete before taking the baseline.\n\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I9ca99f5b447cdf80b129d4fecd675fa51355bcbe\n"
      },
